{"id": "behested-payment-waivers", "title": "Officials may again ask contractors for donations — and donors are not listed", "seconds": 136.0, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "ff5c77decf8b3a6b", "words": 382, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "In San Francisco, officials sometimes ask people to give to a charity or a City program.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.2, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "grants the waivers"}], "zoomOn": "officials", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.36, 1.35, 1.89, 2.46, 2.71, 2.96, 3.04, 3.26, 3.39, 3.46, 4.08, 4.25, 4.3, 4.56]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "That’s called a behested payment.", "t0": 5.32, "t1": 6.95, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "grants the waivers"}], "zoomOn": "officials", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "San Francisco"}, "emph": ["behested payment"], "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 0.62, 0.69, 1.18]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "But what if the giver is a contractor who needs that official?", "t0": 7.07, "t1": 10.66, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "grants the waivers"}], "zoomOn": "officials", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.27, 0.36, 0.47, 0.73, 0.86, 0.95, 1.55, 1.74, 2.05, 2.19]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "sfmap", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "So in January 2022, the City banned asking them.", "t0": 10.66, "t1": 14.33, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "sfmap", "pins": [{"place": "cityhall", "name": "Board of Supervisors", "sub": "grants the waivers"}], "zoomOn": "officials", "scale": 1.9, "kicker": "San Francisco"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.33, 1.07, 1.37, 2.37, 2.52, 2.79, 3.18, 3.5]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[2]"], "text": "The Board of Supervisors can waive that ban. So how many times has it?", "t0": 14.45, "t1": 18.88, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Waivers of the ban", "sub": "approved by the Board of Supervisors"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.38, 0.47, 1.11, 1.27, 1.54, 1.72, 2.53, 2.69, 2.8, 2.97, 3.26, 3.47]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[2]"], "text": "29 times.", "t0": 18.88, "t1": 20.18, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "29", "label": "waivers approved", "sub": "16 of them in 2025"}, "emph": ["29"], "wt": [0.04, 0.73]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 20.7, "t1": 22.36, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.33, 0.4, 0.99, 1.17, 1.24]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "story[0]"], "text": "Why the ban? In 2020, there was a scandal at Public Works.", "t0": 22.58, "t1": 27.07, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["departments with outside accounts", "33"], "b": ["outside accounts", "588"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.32, 1.53, 1.74, 2.04, 2.72, 2.9, 3.03, 3.11, 3.58, 3.7, 4.04]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[5]", "story[0]"], "text": "Then the City’s auditor found 33 departments with 588 outside accounts.", "t0": 27.19, "t1": 32.45, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["departments with outside accounts", "33"], "b": ["outside accounts", "588"]}, "emph": ["588"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.24, 0.53, 0.91, 1.23, 1.85, 2.7, 2.95, 3.27, 3.64, 4.16, 4.69]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "Gifts like these, it warned, look like pay-to-play.", "t0": 32.57, "t1": 35.95, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "create a perceived pay-to-play relationship"}, "emph": ["pay-to-play"], "wt": [0.0, 0.39, 0.6, 1.17, 1.32, 2.24, 2.46, 2.66]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]", "established[3]"], "text": "The first lead: the donor list stopped.", "t0": 36.17, "t1": 38.0, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "The first lead", "text": "Each filing named the donor, the amount and the recipient. 39 filings, 157 payor rows.", "mark": "the donor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 0.82, 0.95, 1.21, 1.41]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[1]", "established[3]"], "text": "Officials used to file a form naming each donor and amount.", "t0": 38.12, "t1": 41.38, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "s1", "kicker": "The first lead", "text": "Each filing named the donor, the amount and the recipient. 39 filings, 157 payor rows.", "mark": "the donor"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.73, 0.81, 1.1, 1.18, 1.58, 1.96, 2.28, 2.71, 2.86]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[0].what", "established[3]"], "text": "The last entries? January to early February 2023.", "t0": 41.5, "t1": 45.88, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "The last entries", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "District Attorney’s inauguration committee, Jan 6 to Feb 2, 2023", "chip": "$34,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.47, 1.39, 2.06, 2.24, 2.59, 3.38, 3.74]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[3]", "suspicious[0].what", "established[3]"], "text": "34,000 dollars for the District Attorney’s inauguration.", "t0": 46.0, "t1": 49.46, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "The last entries", "kicker": "The first lead", "sub": "District Attorney’s inauguration committee, Jan 6 to Feb 2, 2023", "chip": "$34,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.68, 1.07, 1.72, 1.87, 1.97, 2.34, 2.73]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "slam", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "suspicious[0].why", "established[16]"], "text": "Then the City marked the table historical. No public list of who gave, or how much.", "t0": 49.58, "t1": 54.45, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "slam", "words": ["Historical"], "sub": "last updated Feb 11, 2023 · donor reports: 0 filings, last updated June 2019"}, "emph": ["historical"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.25, 0.49, 0.75, 0.86, 1.24, 2.37, 2.61, 2.92, 3.16, 3.27, 3.51, 4.07, 4.28, 4.45]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[2]", "established[7]"], "text": "The second lead is what replaced it: a list of 29 waivers.", "t0": 54.67, "t1": 59.09, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A list of 29 waivers", "kicker": "The second lead", "sub": "who may ask, and for what"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.59, 1.03, 1.22, 1.38, 1.86, 2.64, 2.76, 3.03, 3.15, 3.83]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Only groups, like various City contractors. No names. No amounts.", "t0": 59.21, "t1": 63.65, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Various City contractors"}, "emph": ["No names"], "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.79, 1.02, 1.42, 1.67, 2.75, 2.99, 3.71, 3.93]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what"], "text": "Two name City contractors as the payors.", "t0": 63.77, "t1": 65.71, "shot": "b10sb", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "2 name City contractors as the payors"}, "emph": ["City contractors"], "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.44, 0.7, 1.26, 1.37, 1.45]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[8]"], "text": "Since February 2025, though, 19 waivers have promised the Board a report of donations from interested parties.", "t0": 65.83, "t1": 71.81, "shot": "b11b", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "A promised report", "kicker": "Since Resolution 056-25", "sub": "19 of the 29 waivers"}, "emph": ["19"], "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.74, 1.0, 1.54, 2.13, 2.55, 2.9, 3.04, 3.39, 3.49, 3.76, 3.85, 4.25, 4.34, 4.87, 5.06, 5.52]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[10]"], "text": "Five reports are on file. Two name donors who are interested parties.", "t0": 71.93, "t1": 75.87, "shot": "b11c", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Fidelity Charitable (Google)", "$1,000,000.00"], "b": ["The Prado Group, Inc.", "$51,000.00"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.79, 0.94, 1.11, 1.96, 2.25, 2.5, 2.79, 2.92, 3.04, 3.47]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[10]"], "text": "Google, through Fidelity Charitable: 1,000,000 dollars.", "t0": 75.99, "t1": 80.1, "shot": "b11c", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Fidelity Charitable (Google)", "$1,000,000.00"], "b": ["The Prado Group, Inc.", "$51,000.00"]}, "emph": ["1,000,000"], "wt": [0.0, 0.85, 1.12, 1.55, 2.5, 2.91, 3.25, 3.61]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["established[10]"], "text": "The Prado Group: 51,000.", "t0": 80.22, "t1": 82.36, "shot": "b11c", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Fidelity Charitable (Google)", "$1,000,000.00"], "b": ["The Prado Group, Inc.", "$51,000.00"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 1.01, 1.65]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[15]", "established[9]", "established[13]"], "text": "The reports at the Clerk add Crankstart: 10 million dollars, solicited by the Mayor’s Office.", "t0": 82.48, "t1": 88.2, "shot": "b11e", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "c6q1", "kicker": "Homelessness department report, Resolution 126-25", "text": "Crankstart: $10,000,000 for Breaking the Cycle, solicited by the Mayor’s Office", "mark": "$10,000,000"}, "emph": ["10 million dollars"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.54, 0.63, 0.75, 1.12, 1.43, 2.54, 3.07, 3.43, 4.25, 4.78, 4.9, 5.0, 5.33]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "count", "ref": ["established[9]", "established[15]", "next[4]"], "text": "Yet the Mayor’s reports say none was solicited. For 8 waivers, no report is on record.", "t0": 88.32, "t1": 94.08, "shot": "b11d", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "8", "label": "reports due, none on record", "sub": "the Mayor’s reports say no interested party was solicited"}, "emph": ["8"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.27, 0.61, 1.1, 1.81, 2.06, 2.19, 3.2, 3.37, 3.59, 4.46, 4.71, 5.12, 5.27, 5.4]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The third lead is the pace.", "t0": 94.3, "t1": 95.6, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Waivers approved each year", "rows": [["2023", "5"], ["2024", "4"], ["2025", "16"], ["2026, to Oct 2", "4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.41, 0.6, 0.72, 0.82]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "5 waivers in 2023.", "t0": 95.72, "t1": 97.36, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Waivers approved each year", "rows": [["2023", "5"], ["2024", "4"], ["2025", "16"], ["2026, to Oct 2", "4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.67, 0.77, 1.04]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "4 in 2024. And in 2025?", "t0": 97.48, "t1": 101.23, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Waivers approved each year", "rows": [["2023", "5"], ["2024", "4"], ["2025", "16"], ["2026, to Oct 2", "4"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.45, 0.76, 2.06, 2.23, 2.31, 2.58]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[2]"], "text": "16.", "t0": 101.23, "t1": 101.98, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "16", "label": "waivers in a single year"}, "emph": ["16"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[4]"], "text": "The fourth lead is in the old data.", "t0": 102.6, "t1": 104.22, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Summer Together", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "three 2021 filings by the children’s department", "chip": "$31,153,860"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.47, 0.72, 0.87, 0.95, 1.09, 1.27]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[4]"], "text": "Three 2021 filings by the children’s department", "t0": 104.34, "t1": 107.28, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Summer Together", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "three 2021 filings by the children’s department", "chip": "$31,153,860"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.63, 0.95, 1.52, 1.99, 2.11, 2.2, 2.58]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[4]"], "text": "list 31.15 million dollars under donors.", "t0": 107.28, "t1": 111.8, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Summer Together", "kicker": "The fourth lead", "sub": "three 2021 filings by the children’s department", "chip": "$31,153,860"}, "wt": [0.04, 1.38, 2.05, 2.32, 2.52, 2.88, 3.3, 3.82, 4.05]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "story[4]"], "text": "But those donors are youth nonprofits. They didn’t give the money.", "t0": 111.92, "t1": 114.75, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Real donor", "sub": "not named"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Children’s department", "sub": "files the form"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Youth nonprofits", "sub": "listed as payors"}], "kicker": "Who really paid?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.4, 0.71, 0.82, 1.02, 1.99, 2.16, 2.34, 2.48, 2.57]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "story[4]"], "text": "They got it. The real donor isn’t named.", "t0": 114.87, "t1": 117.06, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "money", "name": "Real donor", "sub": "not named"}, {"art": "cityhall", "name": "Children’s department", "sub": "files the form"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Youth nonprofits", "sub": "listed as payors"}], "kicker": "Who really paid?"}, "emph": ["got it"], "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.39, 0.87, 1.02, 1.24, 1.54, 1.77]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "The fifth lead is a bill before the Board.", "t0": 117.28, "t1": 118.99, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "A pending bill", "kicker": "The fifth lead", "sub": "File 250947"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.38, 0.56, 0.68, 0.75, 1.01, 1.26, 1.36]}, {"scene": "lead5", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[6]"], "text": "It would let the Board waive the ban for its own members.", "t0": 119.11, "t1": 121.62, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "A pending bill", "kicker": "The fifth lead", "sub": "File 250947"}, "emph": ["its own members"], "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.27, 0.43, 0.53, 0.91, 1.17, 1.29, 1.59, 1.73, 1.88, 2.05]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The records don’t show any waiver was misused, or any donor got a favor.", "t0": 121.84, "t1": 125.6, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That any waiver was misused", "That any donor got a favor", "How much was raised"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.44, 0.65, 0.87, 1.06, 1.38, 1.54, 2.6, 2.75, 2.91, 3.19, 3.33, 3.4]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "What would settle it? The clerk’s file for each waiver.", "t0": 125.72, "t1": 128.61, "shot": "b23", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "The Board clerk’s file for each waiver"}, {"who": "", "what": "Donor lists from the departments named"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.29, 0.56, 1.24, 1.4, 1.76, 2.13, 2.29, 2.53]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status"], "text": "The ban stands. 29 waivers so far, and two bills pending.", "t0": 128.73, "t1": 132.88, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.47, 1.46, 1.97, 2.29, 2.5, 2.82, 3.02, 3.33, 3.72]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 133.0, "t1": 135.09, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.31, 0.4, 0.47, 1.18, 1.36, 1.45]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "Why the ban", "lead1": "Lead 1 · the list stops", "lead2": "Lead 2 · no donor names", "lead3": "Lead 3 · 16 in one year", "lead4": "Lead 4 · 97% mis-entered", "lead5": "Lead 5 · a waiver for itself", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "flow", "hook": "timeline"}